# The jump key under a ceiling at head height (a room of the palace on
# map 40): there is no room to jump, he used to bump his head and hop on
# the spot; now he shakes his head and stays where he is
args: --map 40 --pos 12087,10139,48
do: t5;jump;t8;where:1
expect: jump: no room (shakes his head)
expect: where 1: 12087,10139,48
